        <p>WHAT IS COFFEE ESSENCE? It is a liquid extract of the useful constituents of Fine Coffee. A Teaspoonful added to boiling water gives a cup of deliciou.&gt; Coffee in an instant, superior to the best ground Coffee. THOS. SYMINGTON St CO. EDINBURGH, are the Makers. To be obtained everywhere, ir 0-3. and Is. Bottles.</p>
